    "detailed_description": "Subway Surge is a fun endless runner game featuring pirate heroes. Navigate using your mouse, and collect gold coins by running, jumping, and sliding. Help the pirates gather all the gold!<br><br>Run through the city, continually updating your high score by collecting coins and power-ups. How far can you run?<br><br>In Subway Surge, you'll embark on a thrilling adventure with a crew of daring pirates. As you dash through bustling city streets, you'll need to dodge obstacles, leap over barriers, and slide under tight spaces. The vibrant graphics and fast-paced gameplay will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FEATURES:<br></li><li>Stunning environments<br></li><li>New and challenging obstacles<br></li><li>Additional power-ups<br></li><li>Unique abilities for each character<br></li><li>Heart-racing gameplay</li></ul>",
